Package: owdata
Title: Index of openwashdata R Data Packages
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lars", "Schöbitz", , "lars@lse.de", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2196-5015")))
Description: An index and documentation metapackage for the openwashdata
    collection of R data packages. Ships harvested catalog tables of
    packages, datasets, and variables as package data, and provides
    search and install helpers together with a searchable catalog
    website.
License: CC BY 4.0
Depends:
    R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports:
    tibble,
    tools,
    utils
Suggests:
    jsonlite,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/Needs/website: rmarkdown, DT
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-GB
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
URL: https://github.com/openwashdata/owdata
BugReports: https://github.com/openwashdata/owdata/issues
